{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/aa542f70617b318d76229ddc3d2411b0.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dream Strikers</strong> is a <strong>stylish 3D action fighting game</strong> that\u2019s easy to pick up yet deep to master. Featuring high-mobility combat and flashy combo effects, players can choose their side and battle across cyber-fantasy arenas where dodging and chaining attacks combine into intense combat moments. Whether in solo arcade challenges or local 1v1 battles, each match delivers fast-paced, accessible action. Every fight is a clash of conviction and obsession.<strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/0a59f09a4798bcb99d99285251806fc8.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts stunning visual performance\u2014from dynamic facial animations and combat lighting effects to intricate scene details, all designed to deliver realism and impact. With high-end rendering, every battle feels like a cinematic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/05cfaa5018bfbd661a4c90ef0e0fdc76.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional fighters, <strong>Dream Strikers</strong> features a dual camera system that dynamically switches between 2D and 3D perspectives, preserving combo freedom while highlighting movement and action detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/d1e1464c1c4307ef755a0eee7fb0fb6c.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the moment is right, unleash your power with <strong>Ultimate Finishers</strong>\u2014high-impact cinematic attacks that can turn the tide in an instant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/ea867da7d1b9470514885bed14ba891d.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system <strong>encourages players to freely combine skills based on the flow of battle</strong>, allowing for unique styles and strategies. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned player, there\u2019s depth to explore, and each character brings distinct mechanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/74d6bc69f9b248686d6e6b087230f6ca.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse cast of characters, each with unique stories and fighting styles, players will experience a world full of challenges and emotion. As the narrative unfolds, uncover hidden truths and confront the nightmares that lurk in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 1v1 multiplayer for head-to-head matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo arcade mode with custom-designed AI challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters with distinct moves and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 immersive dream-themed battle stages including skies, ruins, and cyber cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced mobility combat and cinematic finishing moves in every match.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183230?t=1773102802","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/629d13e047b8baafeb758779a905eb2d12b1fc08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773102802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/55ba6a7f72de717615cd31bac92331b335a42551/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773102802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/55ba6a7f72de717615cd31bac92331b335a42551/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773102802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3824660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Discord to support us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5d15637fbc6ca5225d4e8504c1b5a881.avif?t=1773102802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras_big/5d15637fbc6ca5225d4e8504c1b5a881.webp?t=1773102802 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6b26bc9e5a448988ada96c3bea29c49e.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/aa542f70617b318d76229ddc3d2411b0.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dream Strikers</strong> is a <strong>stylish 3D action fighting game</strong> that\u2019s easy to pick up yet deep to master. Featuring high-mobility combat and flashy combo effects, players can choose their side and battle across cyber-fantasy arenas where dodging and chaining attacks combine into intense combat moments. Whether in solo arcade challenges or local 1v1 battles, each match delivers fast-paced, accessible action. Every fight is a clash of conviction and obsession.<strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/0a59f09a4798bcb99d99285251806fc8.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts stunning visual performance\u2014from dynamic facial animations and combat lighting effects to intricate scene details, all designed to deliver realism and impact. With high-end rendering, every battle feels like a cinematic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/05cfaa5018bfbd661a4c90ef0e0fdc76.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional fighters, <strong>Dream Strikers</strong> features a dual camera system that dynamically switches between 2D and 3D perspectives, preserving combo freedom while highlighting movement and action detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/a7c5a107be06640443f41498e234e2a3.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/d1e1464c1c4307ef755a0eee7fb0fb6c.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the moment is right, unleash your power with <strong>Ultimate Finishers</strong>\u2014high-impact cinematic attacks that can turn the tide in an instant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/6976d11e5b97ee018ed7d7fa16df83a9.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/ea867da7d1b9470514885bed14ba891d.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system <strong>encourages players to freely combine skills based on the flow of battle</strong>, allowing for unique styles and strategies. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned player, there\u2019s depth to explore, and each character brings distinct mechanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.poster.avif?t=1773102802\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/7673b64ee17a9d2c7e47f6cbe968df25.webm?t=1773102802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/74d6bc69f9b248686d6e6b087230f6ca.avif?t=1773102802\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse cast of characters, each with unique stories and fighting styles, players will experience a world full of challenges and emotion. As the narrative unfolds, uncover hidden truths and confront the nightmares that lurk in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 1v1 multiplayer for head-to-head matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo arcade mode with custom-designed AI challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters with distinct moves and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 immersive dream-themed battle stages including skies, ruins, and cyber cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced mobility combat and cinematic finishing moves in every match.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Burn Out Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/e43c4f90cc97cb6898a15f9fd828cfd138a83e81/header.jpg?t=1773102802","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183230/845916/5cd20b458edf9901115ebd690e82ab703e2788e5/1750878670/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762012411","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183230/845916/5cd20b458edf9901115ebd690e82ab703e2788e5/1750878670/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762012411","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183230/845916/5cd20b458edf9901115ebd690e82ab703e2788e5/1750878670/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762012411","id":257110947,"name":"DreamStrikers | Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110947/95236063d88d0687e8f32369f8d0a221cd4382b6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762012411"}],"name":"Dream Strikers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K/AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060/AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Direct